 data-v-25cf3c40 data-v-a186de6a><h2 class="ingredient-header text-h2-renewal" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="recipe-serving" data-v-25cf3c40> 材料 <span data-v-25cf3c40>【2人分】</span></span></h2><ul class="ingredient-list" data-v-25cf3c40><!----><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>牛切り落とし肉</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>200g</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><a href="/categories/7303" class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40> アスパラ </a><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>2本(40g)</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><a href="/categories/2736" class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40> 玉ねぎ </a><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>1/4個</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>酒</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>大さじ1/2</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>片栗粉</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>大さじ1/2</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>ごま油</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>大さじ1/2</span></li><li class="ingredient-group__header" data-v-25cf3c40>☆調味料</li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>酒</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>大さじ1</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>砂糖</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>小さじ1</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>みりん</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>大さじ1</span></li><li class="ingredient" data-v-25cf3c40><span class="ingredient-name" data-v-25cf3c40>しょうゆ</span><span class="ingredient-serving" data-v-25cf3c40>大さじ1と1/2</span></li></ul><div data-v-25cf3c40><a href="https://corp.every.tv/cooking_notes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cooking-notice" data-v-25cf3c40><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="icon-info" data-v-25cf3c40><path d="M12 1c6.067 0 11 4.935 11 11s-4.933 11-11 11C5.934 23 1 18.065 1 12S5.934 1 12 1zm0 2.42c-4.731 0-8.581 3.849-8.581 8.58s3.85 8.58 8.581 8.58 8.581-3.849 8.581-8.58S16.731 3.42 12 3.42zm0 6.379c.668 0 1.21.542 1.21 1.21v5.28a1.21 1.21 0 01-2.42 0v-5.28c0-.668.542-1.21 1.21-1.21zm0-3.464a1.21 1.21 0 11-.001 2.421A1.21 1.21 0 0112 6.335z" data-v-25cf3c40></path></svg><span class="text-notice" data-v-25cf3c40>料理を楽しむにあたって</span></a></div></div><div data-v-a186de6a></div><!----></div><!----><div class="delish-recipe-steps" data-v-13cd9798 data-v-a186de6a><h2 class="text-h2-renewal recipe-steps-title" data-v-13cd9798>手順</h2><!----><ol class="steps" data-v-13cd9798><li class="step" data-v-13cd9798><div class="delish-recipe-step-item" data-v-2ffab46a data-v-13cd9798><div id="step-video-1" class="step-image-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><div class="delish-step-player delish-step-player" data-v-642f7b0b data-v-2ffab46a><div class="video-player delish-player-custom-skin" data-v-5513e455 data-v-642f7b0b><video preload="none" poster="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/1.jpg?version=1747799385" playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" class="video-js" data-v-5513e455><source src="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/1.m3u8" type="application/x-mpegURL" fetchpriority="high" data-v-5513e455></video></div></div></div><p class="step-num" data-v-2ffab46a>1</p><div class="step-text-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><p class="step-desc" data-v-2ffab46a>アスパラは根元から1〜2cmの硬い部分を切り落とす。根元に近い1/3部分をピーラーでむき、3cm幅の斜め切りにする。玉ねぎは薄切りにする。</p><!----><!----></div></div></li><li class="step" data-v-13cd9798><div class="delish-recipe-step-item" data-v-2ffab46a data-v-13cd9798><div id="step-video-2" class="step-image-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><div class="delish-step-player delish-step-player" data-v-642f7b0b data-v-2ffab46a><div class="video-player delish-player-custom-skin" data-v-5513e455 data-v-642f7b0b><video preload="none" poster="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/2.jpg?version=1747799385" playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" class="video-js" data-v-5513e455><source src="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/2.m3u8" type="application/x-mpegURL" fetchpriority="high" data-v-5513e455></video></div></div></div><p class="step-num" data-v-2ffab46a>2</p><div class="step-text-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><p class="step-desc" data-v-2ffab46a>ボウルに牛肉を入れ、酒、片栗粉を加えて揉み込む。</p><!----><!----></div></div></li><li class="step" data-v-13cd9798><div class="delish-recipe-step-item" data-v-2ffab46a data-v-13cd9798><div id="step-video-3" class="step-image-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><div class="delish-step-player delish-step-player" data-v-642f7b0b data-v-2ffab46a><div class="video-player delish-player-custom-skin" data-v-5513e455 data-v-642f7b0b><video preload="none" poster="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/3.jpg?version=1747799385" playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" class="video-js" data-v-5513e455><source src="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/3.m3u8" type="application/x-mpegURL" fetchpriority="high" data-v-5513e455></video></div></div></div><p class="step-num" data-v-2ffab46a>3</p><div class="step-text-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><p class="step-desc" data-v-2ffab46a>フライパンにごま油を入れて熱し、牛肉を入れて中火で肉の色が変わるまで炒め、アスパラ、玉ねぎを加えて全体に油がまわるまで炒める。</p><!----><!----></div></div></li><li class="step" data-v-13cd9798><div class="delish-recipe-step-item" data-v-2ffab46a data-v-13cd9798><div id="step-video-4" class="step-image-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><div class="delish-step-player delish-step-player" data-v-642f7b0b data-v-2ffab46a><div class="video-player delish-player-custom-skin" data-v-5513e455 data-v-642f7b0b><video preload="none" poster="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/4.jpg?version=1747799385" playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" class="video-js" data-v-5513e455><source src="https://media.delishkitchen.tv/recipe/221505023320786136/steps/4.m3u8" type="application/x-mpegURL" fetchpriority="high" data-v-5513e455></video></div></div></div><p class="step-num" data-v-2ffab46a>4</p><div class="step-text-wrap" data-v-2ffab46a><p class="step-desc" data-v-2ffab46a>アスパラがしんなりとしたら☆を加えて炒め合わせる。</p><!----><!----></div></div></li></ol></div></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div id="delish-recipe-top-summary-cooking-reports" class="delish-recipe-top-summary-cooking-reports" data-v-08998891 data-v-a186de6a><h2 class="title text-h2-renewal" data-v-08998891>レビュー</h2><div class="delish-cooking-reports-top-summary" data-v-28d67760 data-v-08998891><div class="review-stars" data-v-28d67760><div class="delish-recipe-review-stars" data-v-86131886 data-v-28d67760><div class="delish-recipe-review-star" data-v-86131886><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="icon icon-star yellow middle" style="margin-right:2px;" data-v-86131886 data-v-86131886><path d="M22.892 9.239c-.288-.926-1.08-1.524-2.015-1.524h-5.241l-1.62-5.19C13.725 1.598 12.935 1 12 1c-.936 0-1.727.598-2.016 1.525l-1.62 5.19H3.123c-.936 0-1.728.598-2.017 1.524-.287.926.015 1.893.77 2.466l4.242 3.208-1.62 5.19c-.289.926.013 1.895.77 2.467a2.02 2.02 0 002.491 0L12 19.364l4.241 3.207c.378.286.81.429 1.245.428a2.06 2.06 0 001.247-.43c.755-.571 1.058-1.54.769-2.465l-1.62-5.19 4.24-3.208c.757-.574 1.059-1.541.77-2.467z" data-v-86131886 data-v-86131886></path></svg></div><div class="delish-recipe-review-star" data-v-86131886><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="icon icon-star yellow middle" style="margin-right:2px;" data-v-86131886 data-v-86131886><path d="M22.892 9.239c-.288-.926-1.08-1.524-2.015-1.524h-5.241l-1.62-5.19C13.725 1.598 12.935 1 12 1c-.936 0-1.727.598-2.016 1.525l-1.62 5.19H3.123c-.936 0-1.728.598-2.017 1.524-.287.926.015 1.893.77 2.466l4.242 3.208-1.62 5.19c-.289.926.013 1.895.77 