かずから汁物まで！炊き込みご飯に合うレシピまとめ",description:"炊き込みご飯は様々な食材で作れるので、無限に組み合わせが楽しめ、幅広い年代に人気のメニューのひとつです。しかし、ご飯そのものにしっかりと味がつくので、どんなおかずを合わせるか、献立に悩んでしまう方も多いのではないでしょうか。\n\nそこでこの記事では、炊き込みご飯に合わせやすいおかずをジャンルに分けて一挙にご紹介します。",thumbnail:a,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F293574859206689036\u002F1.jpg?version=1700631782",has_indexes:d,opened_at:"2021-12-30T03:00:00Z",revised_at:"2021-12-29T15:31:28Z",indexes:a,contents:a,display_metadata:d}],square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:s,webp_poster_url:aK},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:s,webp_poster_url:aK},ingredient_groups:[{id:e,name:a,recipe_ingredients:[{ingredient_id:3339,name:u,servings1:"200g",link:c},{ingredient_id:2158,name:i,servings1:"2本(40g)",link:"\u002Fcategories\u002F7303"},{ingredient_id:46,name:v,servings1:"1\u002F4個",link:"\u002Fcategories\u002F2736"},{ingredient_id:aL,name:j,servings1:N,link:c},{ingredient_id:27,name:t,servings1:N,link:c},{ingredient_id:72,name:y,servings1:N,link:c}]},{id:23878,name:"☆調味料",recipe_ingredients:[{ingredient_id:aL,name:j,servings1:aM,link:c},{ingredient_id:39,name:p,servings1:"小さじ1",link:c},{ingredient_id:22,name:z,servings1:aM,link:c},{ingredient_id:2653,name:l,servings1:"大さじ1と1\u002F2",link:c}]}],recipe_tags:[{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:h,tag_name:"主菜・おかず"},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:aN,tag_name:aO},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:aP,tag_name:aQ},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:O,tag_name:i},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:$,tag_name:aa},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:Z,tag_name:_},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:aR,tag_name:aS},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:P,tag_name:Q},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:18234,tag_name:y},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:A,tag_name:B},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,tag_id:22196,tag_name:l}],recipe_genre:{id:R,kind_id:432,name:"和食"},recipe_category:{id:h,kind_id:aT,name:"主菜"},recipe_qas:a,recipe_servings:[{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,servings:h,name:"2人分"}],recipe_steps:[{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,step:h,description:"アスパラは根元から1〜2cmの硬い部分を切り落とす。根元に近い1\u002F3部分をピーラーでむき、3cm幅の斜め切りにする。玉ねぎは薄切りにする。",point:c,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F1.jpg?version=1747799385"}},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,step:aT,description:"ボウルに牛肉を入れ、酒、片栗粉を加えて揉み込む。",point:c,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F2.m3u8",poster_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F2.jpg?version=1747799385"}},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,step:g,description:"フライパンにごま油を入れて熱し、牛肉を入れて中火で肉の色が変わるまで炒め、アスパラ、玉ねぎを加えて全体に油がまわるまで炒める。",point:c,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F3.m3u8",poster_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F3.jpg?version=1747799385"}},{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,step:aU,description:"アスパラがしんなりとしたら☆を加えて炒め合わせる。",point:c,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F4.m3u8",poster_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F221505023320786136\u002Fsteps\u002F4.jpg?version=1747799385"}}],nutrient:{recipe_id:f,recipe_id_str:f,items:[{name:aV,display_name:aV,icon_type:"calorie",amount:"332kcal",is_locked:b,iconComponent:"delish-icon-cooking-kcal"},{name:aW,display_name:aW,icon_type:"carbohydrate",amount:"13g",is_locked:b,iconComponent:"delish-icon-cooking-bread"},{name:aX,display_name:aX,icon_type:"lipid",amount:"19.4g",is_locked:b,iconComponent:"delish-icon-cooking-oil"},{name:"タンパク質",display_name:"たんぱく質",icon_type:"protein",amount:"20g",is_locked:b,iconComponent:"delish-icon-cooking-egg"},{name:aY,display_name:aY,icon_type:"saccharide",amount:"12.3g",is_locked:b,iconComponent:"delish-icon-cooking-candy"},{name:"塩分量",display_name:"塩分",icon_type:"salt",amount:"2.1g",is_locked:b,iconComponent:"delish-icon-cooking-salt"}]},banner:a},breadcrumbs:{main:[{id:aN,name:aO,title:a,description:a,recommended_recipe_heading:a,parents:a,children:a,representative_recipe:a,recommended_recipes:a,recipes:[{id:aZ,id_str:aZ,lead:"主材料2つで作る♪",title:"豚肉となすの照り炒め",description:"ポン酢を使った甘いたれの味付けでごはんが進む！なすと豚肉に片栗粉をまぶして少し多めの油で炒めることで、表面に膜を作り、しっとりでジューシーな仕上がりになります。今晩の一品にいかがでしょうか？",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F314018940663628189\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:a_,webp_poster_url:a$},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F314018940663628189\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:a_,webp_poster_url:a$},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"豚こま切れ肉"},{name:"なす"},{name:o},{name:t},{name:ba}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:p},{name:bb},{name:C}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}],suggests:a,basic_cooking_recipes:a},{id:A,name:B,title:a,description:a,recommended_recipe_heading:a,parents:a,children:a,representative_recipe:a,recommended_recipes:a,recipes:[{id:D,id_str:D,lead:bc,title:bd,description:be,state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:bf,poster_url:E,webp_poster_url:F},square_mp4_video:{url:bg,poster_url:E,webp_poster_url:F},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:bh},{name:j},{name:m},{name:t},{name:o},{name:bi}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:z},{name:l},{name:G}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}],suggests:a,basic_cooking_recipes:a}],sub:[{id:A,name:B,recipe:{id:D,id_str:D,lead:bc,title:bd,description:be,state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:bf,poster_url:E,webp_poster_url:F},square_mp4_video:{url:bg,poster_url:E,webp_poster_url:F},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:bh},{name:j},{name:m},{name:t},{name:o},{name:bi}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:z},{name:l},{name:G}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}},{id:aR,name:aS,recipe:{id:bj,id_str:bj,lead:"子供も喜ぶ！",title:"菜の花のツナマヨ和え",description:"菜の花をツナマヨであえた簡単レシピです。ツナマヨとごまのコクが苦味のある菜の花にぴったりです♪菜の花が苦手な方でも食べやすいのでぜひお試しください！",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F176149848481858687\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:bk,webp_poster_url:bl},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F176149848481858687\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:bk,webp_poster_url:bl},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"菜の花"},{name:"ツナ缶[水煮]"},{name:G},{name:"めんつゆ[3倍濃縮]"},{name:ba}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}},{id:O,name:i,recipe:{id:bm,id_str:bm,lead:"すりごまが隠し味！",title:"アスパラのツナマヨサラダ",description:"アスパラをツナ缶とあえた手軽な一品です。味付けはポン酢とマヨネーズを使って簡単にでき、白すりごまを加えて風味とコクをアップさせました。サンドイッチの具にもおすすめです♪",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F299681250048737693\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:bn,webp_poster_url:bo},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F299681250048737693\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:bn,webp_poster_url:bo},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"ツナ缶[オイル漬け]"},{name:i}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:bb},{name:G},{name:bp}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}},{id:aP,name:aQ,recipe:{id:bq,id_str:bq,lead:"簡単アレンジ♪",title:"レンジで青椒牛肉絲",description:"青椒牛肉絲を簡単に作れるようにアレンジしました。耐熱容器に入れてレンジで加熱するだけ！火を使わずに作るので、忙しい時のおかずや朝のお弁当の一品に最適です。よりおいしく作れるように材料と工程を見直しました。2019年10月",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F139651030374679002\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:br,webp_poster_url:bs},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F139651030374679002\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:br,webp_poster_url:bs},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"牛バラ肉[焼肉用]"},{name:"たけのこ[水煮・細切り]"},{name:"ピーマン"}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:j},{name:l},{name:t}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:j},{name:p},{name:H},{name:bt}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}},{id:P,name:Q,recipe:{id:bu,id_str:bu,lead:"味染み込む♪",title:"基本の肉豆腐",description:"肉豆腐とは豆腐と牛肉、ねぎで煮る家庭料理のこと。蒸し煮にすることで効率よく火が通り、甘辛い煮汁を具材に染み込ませるのが人気のうま煮です。牛肉で作ることが多いですが、合い挽き肉や豚肉、鶏肉でもお作りいただけます。煮崩れしにくいので木綿豆腐や焼き豆腐がおすすめですが、絹ごしでもOK。ねぎの代わりに白菜や玉ねぎ、大根、きのこなどを使ってもおすすめです。",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F194111675098464660\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:bv,webp_poster_url:bw},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F194111675098464660\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:bv,webp_poster_url:bw},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:u},{name:"木綿豆腐"},{name:S},{name:o},{name:p}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:j},{name:l},{name:C}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}}]},basicRecipe:{},topSummaryCookingReport:{rate_average:4.4,star:4.5,total_report_count:346,list:[{id:"393021026671264812",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F393021026671264812.unknown?version=1776383817",comment:"牛肉がお高かったので豚の切り落としで、玉ねぎは小さかったので半分、他はレシピ通りに作りました！美味しかったです！レシピの写真で玉ねぎが糸こんにゃくに見えたので入ってるのかと思ってました(笑)入れても良さげな気がします。",rate:n,likes_count:23,posted_at:bx,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-16T23:56:57Z",created_at:bx,user:{id:by,has_name:d,name:bz,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:by,has_name:d,name:bz,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"361834742397535366",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F361834742397535366.jpg?version=1776932043",comment:"牛肩と牛ももの切り落としをミックスして入れました。お肉が少し多かった(約280g)ので、調味料を多め(約1.5倍)に投入。アスパラは細かったので3本。玉ねぎは半分入れました。\n程良く丁度いい味付け具合です。濃すぎず薄すぎず、ご飯が進みました！美味しいです。\n牛肉が好きな人は、いいと思います。辛みを入れてもピリッとして美味しいかもしれません。",rate:n,likes_count:16,posted_at:bA,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-23T08:14:03Z",created_at:bA,user:{id:bB,has_name:d,name:bC,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bB,has_name:d,name:bC,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"409568823973250154",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F409568823973250154.unknown?version=1775632819",comment:"アスパラは肉と同時に入れました！\nめっちゃ簡単でおいしいです✨ \nご飯に合います！",rate:n,likes_count:k,posted_at:bD,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-08T07:20:19Z",created_at:bD,user:{id:bE,has_name:d,name:bF,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bE,has_name:d,name:bF,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"514373267729941593",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F514373267729941593.unknown?version=1747737270",comment:"濃い味好きな私にしては、ちょこっとオイスターソースを入れたくなりましたが、家族にはこのままで好評でした!アスパラの食感も良かったです。アスパラと玉ねぎは、牛肉の赤身がまだ見えるくらいで投入しました。\n",rate:n,likes_count:bG,posted_at:bH,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2025-05-20T10:34:30Z",created_at:bH,user:{id:bI,has_name:d,name:bJ,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bI,has_name:d,name:bJ,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"426301267573212252",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F426301267573212252.unknown?version=1775802827",comment:"お弁当に入れました。簡単にできました。美味しかったです。",rate:n,likes_count:bG,posted_at:bK,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-10T06:33:47Z",created_at:bK,user:{id:bL,has_name:d,name:bM,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bL,has_name:d,name:bM,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"412729100134778020",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F412729100134778020.unknown?version=1775802842",comment:"味付けもわが家好みでした🎵牛肉なので、食べごたえのあるおかずで有り難いです😆\n調味料も家にあるものなので、簡単に出来ました❗\n玉ねぎ🧅も1\u002F4個ではなく、1\u002F2個入れてアスパラガスは4本入れました😊調味料は少し多めに入れて美味しく出来ました😋\nアスパラガスが無かったら違う食材を入れて作ってみようと思います😉",rate:n,likes_count:R,posted_at:bN,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-10T06:34:02Z",created_at:bN,user:{id:bO,has_name:d,name:bP,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bO,has_name:d,name:bP,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"387821669655250115",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F387821669655250115.jpg?version=1775813028",comment:"ブロッコリーを追加し、かいわれを乗せました。簡単、美味しくできました。",rate:n,likes_count:R,posted_at:bQ,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-10T09:23:48Z",created_at:bQ,user:{id:bR,has_name:d,name:bS,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bR,has_name:d,name:bS,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"528430500285514806",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F528430500285514806.jpg?version=1775597683",comment:"美味しい！🐮2倍の分量で作ったので少し水っぽさもありましたが、おいしく、ご飯🍚もガンガン進みます！アスパラ玉ねぎもたっぷり☺️おすすめのメニューです！",rate:n,likes_count:n,posted_at:bT,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-04-07T21:34:43Z",created_at:bT,user:{id:bU,has_name:d,name:bV,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bU,has_name:d,name:bV,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"510828793590449328",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F510828793590449328.unknown?version=1777775944",comment:"我が家には丁度いい味。簡単で美味しい。",rate:n,likes_count:n,posted_at:bW,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-05-03T02:39:04Z",created_at:bW,user:{id:bX,has_name:d,name:bY,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:bX,has_name:d,name:bY,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a},{id:"401180594953782291",recipe_id:f,image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fuser-image.delishkitchen.tv\u002Fcooking_report\u002Foriginal\u002F401180594953782291.unknown?version=1777775969",comment:"アスパラが嫌いな人がいない我が家なので6本くらい使いました\n個人的にはブロッコリーとか入れてもおいしいかな？\nと言った感想\nただ芯は入れないほうがいいかな",rate:n,likes_count:aU,posted_at:bZ,liked:b,state:h,updated_at:"2026-05-03T02:39:29Z",created_at:bZ,user:{id:b_,has_name:d,name:b$,has_image:b,image_url:c,zip_code:c,address_city_name:c,email:c,agree_to_use_email:b,token:c,link_facebook:b,link_line:b,link_twitter:b,link_email:b,link_docomo:b,link_softbank:b,link_au:b,link_apple:b,created_at:c},user_profile:{id:b_,has_name:d,name:b$,has_image:b,image_url:c},reply:a}]},cookingBasics:[{tag:{id:O,name:i},recipes:[{id:ca,id_str:ca,lead:q,title:"アスパラのゆで方",description:"根元の方に固い筋があるアスパラは、下処理をしてからゆでることで口当たり良く仕上がります。ちょっとしたポイントをおさえる事でいつもより更においしいアスパラに仕上げましょう♪",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F236915630521975263\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cb,webp_poster_url:cc},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F236915630521975263\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cb,webp_poster_url:cc},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:i}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cd,id_str:cd,lead:q,title:"アスパラガスの下処理方法",description:"アスパラガスの下処理方法をご紹介します！根元が硬く、皮が筋っぽいことが多いアスパラガス。きちんと下処理をしてから調理することで、料理のおいしさをより際立たせてくれます♪下処理をしてあとは、料理に合わせた調理をしてお使いください。",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F306738322288411065\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:ce,webp_poster_url:cf},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F306738322288411065\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:ce,webp_poster_url:cf},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:i}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cg,id_str:cg,lead:q,title:"アスパラの保存方法",description:"アスパラは乾燥しやすいのでキッチンペーパーに包んで野菜室で保存しましょう。立てて保管するのがポイント♪正しく保存しておいしさを長持ちさせましょう！",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F345489207570990214\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:ch,webp_poster_url:ci},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F345489207570990214\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:ch,webp_poster_url:ci},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:i}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cj,id_str:cj,lead:q,title:"アスパラの冷凍保存方法",description:"アスパラは冷凍保存することでおいしさをキープしたまま保存することができます！今回は使い勝手がよい生のまま冷凍する場合とゆでてから冷凍する場合の2種類をご紹介します。どちらも凍ったまま調理可能です。炒め物やスープなど日々の料理に役立ててください。",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F349509033121546532\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:ck,webp_poster_url:cl},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F349509033121546532\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:ck,webp_poster_url:cl},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:i}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cm,id_str:cm,lead:q,title:"アスパラの蒸し方(レンジ)",description:"サラダやメイン料理の添えものなどに便利なゆでアスパラ。今回は電子レンジで手軽に作る方法をご紹介します！メイン料理を作っていてコンロが埋まっている時などに役立ちます♪",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F349692727983604153\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cn,webp_poster_url:co},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F349692727983604153\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cn,webp_poster_url:co},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:i}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}]},{tag:{id:P,name:Q},recipes:[{id:cp,id_str:cp,lead:q,title:"牛肉の冷凍保存方法",description:"牛肉の冷凍保存方法をご紹介します。すぐに使いきれない場合は冷凍保存が便利！最後までおいしく食べられますよ♪ぜひお試しください。",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F379656354421277776\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cq,webp_poster_url:cr},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F379656354421277776\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cq,webp_poster_url:cr},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:I},{name:"牛ももブロック肉"}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}]},{tag:{id:A,name:B},recipes:[{id:cs,id_str:cs,lead:T,title:"鶏肉を美味しく食べるコツ＜鶏もも肉編＞",description:"お肉が柔らかくなるコツとは！？\n臭みをとるコツとは！？\nこの動画で問題解決♡",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F175153039403910225\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:ct,webp_poster_url:cu},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F175153039403910225\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:ct,webp_poster_url:cu},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"鶏もも肉"}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cv,id_str:cv,lead:T,title:"鶏肉を美味しく食べるコツ＜手羽元チューリップ編＞",description:"実は簡単、チューリップ唐揚げ！見た目が華やかになるだけでなく、お肉を食べやすくすることができるので、ひと手間加える価値アリ♪処理にはキッチンバサミを使うので、初めての人でも簡単に作業をすることができます。",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F179331181089653841\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cw,webp_poster_url:cx},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F179331181089653841\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cw,webp_poster_url:cx},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"手羽元"}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cy,id_str:cy,lead:T,title:"鶏肉を美味しく食べるコツ＜ささみ筋取り編＞",description:"筋取りをするのとしないのとでは大違い。ささみ肉の真ん中にある白くて硬い筋はなかなか取るのが難しいですが、この方法だとあっという間です。一度マスターすればささみ料理が楽しくなること間違いなし♪",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F179359016604927057\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cz,webp_poster_url:cA},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F179359016604927057\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cz,webp_poster_url:cA},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"ささみ"}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cB,id_str:cB,lead:q,title:"豚肉の筋切り",description:"豚肉の筋切りをご紹介！筋切りをすることで、焼いた時に肉が反り返ったり縮んだりせず、均一に火が通ります。",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F208346702120223124\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cC,webp_poster_url:cD},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F208346702120223124\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cC,webp_poster_url:cD},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"豚ロース肉[厚切り]"},{name:"豚ロース肉[薄切り]"}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cE,id_str:cE,lead:q,title:"せせりの下処理",description:"焼き鳥屋などでおなじみの「せせり」とは、鶏の首の筋肉部分です。適度な歯ごたえがありながらジューシーな味わいが特徴。一羽から取れる量が限られるため、大変貴重な部位です。下処理のコツを覚えておけば、家庭でもおいしく調理できます♪",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F222373911981982929\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cF,webp_poster_url:cG},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F222373911981982929\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cF,webp_poster_url:cG},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"せせり"}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cH,id_str:cH,lead:"ふわふわに仕上げる！",title:"鶏団子の作り方",description:"シンプルな鶏団子の作り方をご紹介！肉だねをしっかり混ぜて粘りを出すことで肉汁が逃げずにふっくらと仕上がります。そのままスープや鍋の具材にしたり焼き目をつけておつまみに、あんをかけておかずにしたり、幅広いレシピに活用できます♪",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F418241963188290755\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cI,webp_poster_url:cJ},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F418241963188290755\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cI,webp_poster_url:cJ},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"鶏ひき肉"},{name:S},{name:cK},{name:r}]},{recipe_ingredients:[{name:cL},{name:j},{name:t}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a}]}],relatedCurations:[{id:16289,title:"2026\u002F04\u002F08のおすすめ",description:"2026\u002F04\u002F08のおすすめを紹介! 牛肉とアスパラの甘辛炒め 小松菜のわさびナムル 鶏むねとキャベツのオイマヨ炒めなどおすすめの料理動画が簡単に見つかります!",image_url:s,opened_at:"2026-04-07T15:00:00Z"},{id:15884,title:"2025\u002F04\u002F21のおすすめ",description:"2025\u002F04\u002F21のおすすめを紹介! 牛肉とアスパラの甘辛炒め 塩昆布の無限ピーマン なんちゃってハンバーグ丼などおすすめの料理動画が簡単に見つかります!",image_url:s,opened_at:"2025-04-20T15:00:00Z"},{id:15865,title:"2025\u002F04\u002F06のおすすめ",description:"2025\u002F04\u002F06のおすすめを紹介! 牛肉とアスパラの甘辛炒め カリカリポテト ツナナポリタンなどおすすめの料理動画が簡単に見つかります!",image_url:s,opened_at:"2025-04-05T15:00:00Z"},{id:15600,title:"2024\u002F08\u002F11のおすすめ",description:"2024\u002F08\u002F11のおすすめを紹介! 牛肉とアスパラの甘辛炒め チキンとほうれん草のレモンクリームパスタ ニラととうもろこしのペッパーライスなどおすすめの料理動画が簡単に見つかります!",image_url:s,opened_at:"2024-08-10T15:00:00Z"},{id:14044,title:"牛バラ肉・切り落とし肉で作る！人気のレシピ21選",description:"牛肉を使ったレシピを簡単動画でご紹介。切り落とし肉で作る「牛肉とじゃがいものキムチ炒め」「牛肉とキャベツの甘みそ炒め」や、バラ肉で作る「牛肉とれんこんのオイスター炒め」「牛肉と長芋のさっぱり甘酢炒め」など21本のレシピを紹介していますので、日々の献立にぜひお役立てください。",image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F216605142881928351\u002F1.jpg?version=1698281701",opened_at:"2023-08-20T01:30:00Z"},{id:9844,title:"油に合う！アスパラガス炒めのレシピ30選",description:"アスパラガスを使った炒め物のレシピを簡単動画でご紹介。バター炒めや中華炒めなど30本のレシピを紹介していますので、日々の献立にぜひお役立てください。",image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F343982658285469960\u002F1.jpg?version=1703469602",opened_at:"2023-06-21T01:30:55Z"},{id:9230,title:"牛肉切り落としで絶品レシピ40選！炒めて煮込んで美味しく♪",description:"牛肉の切り落としを使ったレシピを簡単動画でご紹介。炒め物（きんぴらやプルコギ）、煮込み（肉どうふ）など40本のレシピを紹介していますので、日々の献立にぜひお役立てください。",image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F190340775433732454\u002F1.jpg?version=1756190102",opened_at:"2023-06-12T01:30:00Z"},{id:8946,title:"肉巻きだけじゃない！牛肉とアスパラを使った料理レシピ10選♪",description:"相性抜群な牛肉とアスパラを使ったレシピを簡単動画でご紹介。オイスター味やにんにくバター味などの炒め物から、サラダやピザまで10本のレシピを紹介しています。お酒のお供のおつまみにもなるので、日々の献立にぜひお役立てください♪",image_url:s,opened_at:"2023-05-31T15:00:00Z"},{id:7903,title:"【牛肉の炒め物】旨み&ボリューム満点！衝撃的に旨いレシピ33選",description:"牛肉を使った炒め物のレシピを簡単動画でご紹介。メインになるおかずなど33レシピ！日々の献立にぜひお役立てください。",image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F232704830357898340\u002F1.jpg?version=1696904341",opened_at:"2023-05-08T01:30:00Z"},{id:7052,title:"アスパラ炒めの人気レシピ30選",description:"香ばしいアスパラの炒め物人気レシピを簡単動画でご紹介。バター醤油炒めやオイスター炒め、中華炒めなどのレシピを30本紹介しているので、日々の献立に是非役立ててみてください♪",image_url:"https:\u002F\u002Fimage.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F136492823095542145\u002F1.jpg?version=1756285382",opened_at:"2023-03-31T15:00:00Z"}]},recipes:{latestRecipes:[],rankingRecipes:[]},recommend:{recommend:a},"related-recipes":{list:[cM,{id:cS,id_str:cS,lead:"ピリッと大人の味わい！",title:"牛たんとアスパラの黒胡椒炒め",description:"黒胡椒がきいた、おつまみにもぴったりな炒め物！アスパラとパプリカで彩りも綺麗に♪さっと炒めて作れるので忙しい夜でも！",state:g,state_premium:e,is_visible:d,is_favorite_free:b,advertiser:a,square_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F198916902343410022\u002F1.m3u8",poster_url:cT,webp_poster_url:cU},square_mp4_video:{url:"https:\u002F\u002Fmedia.delishkitchen.tv\u002Frecipe\u002F198916902343410022\u002F1.mp4",poster_url:cT,webp_poster_url:cU},ingredient_groups:[{recipe_ingredients:[{name:"牛タン"},{name:v},{name:i},{name:U},{name:V},{name:m},{name:w},{name:r},{name:W}]}],calorie:c,cooking_time:c,cooking_tags:a,recipe_detail:a,cooking_reports_container:a},{id:cV,id_str:cV,lead:"さっと炒めて！",title:"牛ステーキ肉の彩り野菜炒め",description:"牛ステーキ肉を贅沢に使った彩り鮮やかな炒めものレシピです。ステーキ肉は一度焼いてから取り出して旨味を閉じ込め